B.aMe=s(["CUSTOM VEHICLE ORDERING: You can now reorder your vehicles on the dashboard using a new drag-and-drop system. Keep your current projects at the top.","ENHANCED DELETION SYNC: Deletions now propagate reliably across your devices while still protecting your local unsynced work.","ANDROID COMPATIBILITY: Standardized file extensions and MIME types to ensure exports are never greyed out in the Android file explorer.","REQUISITE COMPLIANCE: Upgraded the Google Play Billing Library to meet the latest store security and reliability requirements."],t.s)
B.bfl=new A.BG("1.0.4","AUG 28, 2026","ORDERING & SYNC POLISH",B.aMe)
B.b_W=s(["BUILD & PART TRANSFER: You can now export specific assemblies or parts as .dhbbuild files and import them into other vehicles or share them with friends. Perfect for engine swaps or part sales.","LINK MAINTENANCE TO PARTS: Link service tasks directly to specific assemblies or components. Your entire service history now moves with the parts when you transfer them.","CLOUD SYNC RELIABILITY: Optimized the backup process to ensure your cloud data is always a 100% complete and healthy copy of your garage.","UI CONSOLIDATION: Cleaned up the build dashboard by moving Maintenance, PDF, and Specs into a new Build Tools menu (three dots in top right).","WEB IMPORT FIX: Resolved a crash when importing files on the web platform."],t.s)
B.bfk=new A.BG("1.0.3","AUG 27, 2026","BUILD TRANSFER & MAINTENANCE LINKS",B.b_W)
B.b3X=s(['LOCKED VEHICLE ACCESS: Vehicles over your plan limit are no longer completely hidden. You can now view all build data, photos, and specs in a new read-only "Rugged Info" view.',"GLOBAL SEARCH ENHANCEMENTS: Faster indexing and improved relevance when searching through large garages.","STABILITY IMPROVEMENTS: Optimized database performance during large imports and cloud sync operations."],t.s)
B.bfj=new A.BG("1.0.2","AUG 25, 2026","RUGGED READ-ONLY ACCESS",B.b3X)
B.b6c=s(["RUGGED TRACKING: Organize your build by vehicle, assembly, and component.","TORQUE SPECS: Never search for a shop manual again. Track bolt sizes and torque specs for every part.","DIRTY HANDS PRO: Secure cloud sync across devices using your own Google Drive storage."],t.s)
